<div id="urduTextPath">شہزادے قاسم (ع)/زخمی جو رن میں قاسمِ گل پیرہن ہوا</div>
<p>zaqmi jo ran me qaasim-e- gul paihrahan huwa<br />
paida shahaana jode se range kafan huwa<br />
bhaaghe jinaa'n rasool ko baitul hazan huwa<br />
aur fouj-e- kee'n me shaad har ek tegh zan huwa</p>

<p>ghul tha ke round daala hai lashkar ke bagh ko<br />
haa'n ghaazio'n bujhaado hassan ke charaagh ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ghabraa gaye ye sun ke sada sarwar-e- anaam<br />
abbas-e- naamwar se ye us dam kiya kalaam<br />
lo bhaai jung ho chuki qissa huwa tamaam<br />
aaya sooe yateem-e- hassan mout ka payaam</p>

<p>hamshakl-e- mustafa ko bulalo pukaar ke<br />
maango duaa saro'n se amaame utaar ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehke qibla ru hue sultaan-e- kaayenath<br />
dargaah-e- kibriya me duaa ki uttha ke haath<br />
aye qaaleq-e- zamee'n-o- zamaa'n rabb-e- paak zaath<br />
in zalimou ke haath se qaasim ko de najaath</p>

<p>tu haafez-e- jahaa'n hai kareem -ur- raheem hai<br />
ya rab bacha ise ke ye baccha yateem hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nikla ye sab ke mu se ke hai hai hassan ke laal<br />
zainab ne uth ke khol diye apne sar ke baal<br />
seene me hil gaya dil-e- bano-e- qush qisaal<br />
chillayi maa guzar gaya kya mera nou nehaal</p>

<p>abid ka tap se garm badan sard ho gaya<br />
qasim ke chote bhai ka mu zard ho gaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chillayi roke zouja-e- abbas-e- noujawaa'n<br />
ya rab hai tu yateem-e- hassan kaa nigaahbaa'n<br />
sunkar ye ghul dulhan ke bhi aansu huwe rawaa'n<br />
lekar balaaye'n saas pukaari ke meri jaa'n</p>

<p>qaaleq karega raham na aah-o- bukaa karo<br />
dulha pa aa bani hai mai sadqe duaa karo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>is izteraab me jo sunaa saas ka suqan<br />
zanu se sar uthaa ke huwi qibla roo dulhan<br />
aahista ki ye arz ke aye rabb-e- zulmenan<br />
dushman pa fat'ha yaab ho laqte dil -e- hassan</p>

<p>ladne gaye hai tishna dahan teri raah me<br />
rakh mere ibn-e- amm ko tu apni panaah me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>yaa rab dulhan bane mujhe guzri na ek shab<br />
dulha jo margaya to mujhe kya kahenge sab<br />
ab tak to sharm se na hilaaye the mai ne lab<br />
par kya kahoo'n ke ab hai meri rooh par ta'ab</p>

<p>shabbar ke aaftab ka waqt-e ghuroob hai<br />
dulha se pehle mujh ko uthaale to qoob hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sehre ke phool bhi abhi sookhe nahi hai aah<br />
jo aagaya payaam randaape ka ya ilaah<br />
ye aqd tha ke mout thi maatam tha ya ke byaah<br />
baad iske hoga qalq me kyu'n kar mera nibaah</p>

<p>uthu'n jahaan se dilbar-e- shabbar ke saamne<br />
aurat ki mout qoob hai shouhar ke saamne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ghash me jhuka faras pa jo wo gheerat -o- qamar<br />
maara kisi ne farq pa ek gurz taan kar<br />
barchi lagi jo sheesh ki tukde huwa jigar<br />
girte the asp se ke kamar par laga tabar</p>

<p>taareq ki tegh kha ke pukaare imaam ko<br />
faryaad ya hussain bachalo ghulaam ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jhapte jo shaah fouj pa chamka ke zulfeqaar<br />
bijli giri yazeed ke lashkar pa ek baar<br />
is ghaiz me yamee'n se jo aaye sooe yasaar<br />
bhaage phiraake ghodou'n ki baaghou ko sab sawaar</p>

<p>bhagdadh me qoo'n se ran ki zamee'n laal hogayi<br />
dulha ki laash ghodou se pamaal hogayi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dekha imaam ne ke ragadte hain edhiyaa'n<br />
sookhe huwe labo'n pa hai ainthi huwi zabaa'n<br />
damaad se lipat gaye hazrat basad fughaa'n<br />
be jaa'n huwa hussain ke aage wo neemjaa'n</p>

<p>jab laash uthaayi shah ne to choor isteqaan the<br />
sab chand se badan pe sumou ke nashaan the<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>lasha udhar se laaye shahinshaah-e- karbala<br />
doudhe idhar se peet te namoos-e- mustafa<br />
fizza thi aage aage khule sar barahna paa<br />
aayi jo sahan me to ye bewo'n ko di sadaa</p>

<p>hatjaaye jin se door ka naata hai saahibo<br />
dulha dulhan ke leno ko aatha hai saahibo<br />
____________________________</p>